        "text_iyiCkJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>V2 Hoodie & V2 Zipped Hoodie in Fujisusutake</strong></p><p>We had the pleasure of working with MonkeyTime Japan / United Arrows on this very special piece. The V2 is one of our pinnacle silhouettes, and this release marks our first V2 with direct Japanese influence. After countless swatches and fine-tuning to capture the shade exactly, we are proud to present our newest colorway: FUJISUSUTAKE.<br/><br/>This color is deeply rooted in ancient Japanese tradition. It blends fuji-iro (wisteria purple)with susutake-iro (sooty bamboo gray).<br/><br/>It’s been a while since we introduced a new V2 colorway, so we’re especially excited to share this one with you.<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
