        "text_D8mnLJ": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Denim 440 Jacket in Indigo</strong></p><p>Bringing back our Seventh Denim 440 Jacket is made from a Turkish cotton twill denim for this season: the top piece to match our best selling Denim 440 Bermuda Jeans in Indigo. The garment features YKK hardware with poppers as closures and several pleats providing shape to the garment. This pieces has hidden seamless pockets, Seventh signature arch detail at the sleeves and the denim weight is 13.5oz.<br/><br/><br/><strong>Denim 440 Bermuda Jeans in Indigo</strong></p><p>Our best selling denim style: The Seventh Denim Pleat Pants are made from a Turkish cotton twill denim. The garment is wide leg and loose fitting with a Knife Pleat on the center-front of both legs, concealing the hidden front pockets. This piece has YKK hardware, side pleats to maintain the silhouette, the denim weight is 13.5oz<br/><br/></p>"
          }
        }
      },
